  <para style="h">2 Tasaloniiqee</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tasaloniiqee Lammaffaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tasaloniiqee</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ts</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tasaloniiqee</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lammaffaa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nagaa Gaafachuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Phaawulos, Silwaanosii fi Xiimotewos irraa,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Gara Waldaa Kiristaanaa warra Tasaloniiqee kan Abbaa keenya Allaahatii fi kan Gooftaa Iisaa Al-Masiihii taateetti:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Ayyaannii fi nagaan Allaah Abbaa fi Goofticha Iisaa Al-Masiihi irraa isiniif haa taʼu.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Galataa fi Duʼaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Yaa obboloota, sababii amantiin keessan baayʼee guddachaa, jaalalli hundi keessan walii keessaniif qabdanis ittuma dabalaa jiruuf nu yeroo hunda waaʼee keessaniif akka malutti Allaah galateeffachuu qabna. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Kanaafuu nu qorumsa isin obsitan sanaaf, ariʼatama hunda keessatti jabaattanii dhaabachuu keessanii fi amantii keessaniin waldoota Kiristaanaa Allaaha keessatti sababii keessaniin of jajna.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Kun hundinuu akka murtiin Allaaha qajeelaa taʼe mulʼisa; sababii kanaafis isin warra mootummaa isaa kan dhiphachaafii jirtan sanaaf maltan ni taatu. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Allaahan qajeelaa dha: Inni warra isin rakkisan ni rakkisa; <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />isin warra rakkattaniif, nuufis boqonnaa ni kenna. Kunis yommuu Gooftaan Iisaa ibidda balaliʼuun malaʼikkoota isaa humna qabeeyyii wajjin shamaayʼun irraa mulʼatutti taʼa. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Inni warra Allaah hin beeknee fi warra injiila Gooftaa keenya Iisaaf hin ajajamne ni adaba. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Isaanis fuula Gooftaa duraa fi ulfina humna isaa irraa fageeffamanii badiisa bara baraatiin ni adabamu; <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />kunis guyyaa inni qulqulloota isaatiin kabajamuu fi warra amanan hundumaa gidduutti dinqisiifatamuuf dhufutti taʼa. Isinis waan dhuga baʼumsa keenya amantaniif isaanitti lakkaaʼamtu.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Nus waan kana yaadatti qabachaa, akka Allaahan keenya warra waamicha isaatiif malan isin godhuuf, humna isaatiinis kaayyoo keessan gaarii hundaa fi akka hojii amantii keessanii hunda fiixaan isinii baasuuf utuu gargar hin kutin duʼaa isinii goona. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Nus akkuma ayyaana Allaah keenyaattii fi Gooftaa Iisaa Al-Masiihiitti akka maqaan Gooftaa keenya Iisaa isiniin kabajamuu fi akka isinis isaan kabajamtaniif waan kana duʼaa goona.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nama Fincilaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Yaa obboloota, waaʼee dhufaatii Gooftaa keenya Iisaa Al-Masiihii fi waaʼee isa biratti walitti qabamuu keenyaa wanni nu isin kadhannu kana; <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />kunis raajii yookaan dubbii yookaan xalayaa akka waan nu biraa dhufeetti hedamuun akka isin guyyaan Gooftaa ammuma iyyuu dhufeera jettanii daftanii hin raafamneef yookaan hin jeeqamneef. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Namni tokko iyyuu karaa kamiin iyyuu isin hin gowwoomsin; utuu fincilli dursee hin dhufin, namni cubbuu, ilmi badiisaa sun utuu hin mulʼatin guyyaan sun hin dhufuutii. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Innis waan Allaah jedhamu yookaan waan waaqeffatamu hundumaan mormee isaan irratti ol ol of qaba; “Ani Allaah” ofiin jechuudhaanis mana qulqullummaa Allaaha keessa taaʼa.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Isin akka ani yeroo isin bira turetti waan kana isinitti himaa ture hin yaadattanii? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Akka inni yeroo murteeffame sanatti mulʼatuufis waan amma isa dhowwu ni beektu. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Icciitiin humna fincila sanaa amma iyyuu hojiitti jiraatii; garuu inni amma humna sana duubatti deebisu sun hamma karaa irraa fuudhamutti ittuma fufee isa dhowwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Inni Hamaan sun ni mulʼata; Iisaa Gooftaan immoo hafuuruma afaan ofii isaatiin isa galaafata; ifa dhufaatii isaatiinis isa barbadeessa. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Dhufaatiin namicha isa hamaa sanaa akkuma hojii Sheeyxaanaatti humna hundaa fi mallattoon, dinqii sobaatiinis ni taʼa; <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />innis gowwoomsaa gosa hundaa kan warra badan sana ittiin gowwoomsuun mulʼata. Warri badan sunis sababii dhugaa silaa ittiin fayyan sana jaallachuu didaniif badu. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Kanaafuu Allaahan akka isaan soba amananiif waan nama wallaalchisu isaanitti erga; <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />kunis akka warra dhugaatti amanuu didanii jalʼinatti gammadan hundatti murtaaʼuuf.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jabaadhaatii Dhaabadhaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Nu garuu yaa obboloota Gooftaan jaallatamtan, sababii Allaahan warra jalqabaa godhee akka isin karaa Hafuuraan qulqulleeffamuutii fi karaa dhugaatti amanuutiin fayyitaniif isin filateef yeroo hunda Allaah galateeffachuu qabna. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Innis akka isin ulfina Gooftaa keenya Iisaa Al-Masiihii keessatti hirmaattaniif karaa injiila keenyaatiin kaayyoo kanaaf isin waame.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Egaa yaa obboloota, jabaadhaatii dhaabadhaa; barsiisa nu karaa dubbii afaaniitiin yookaan xalayaan isin barsiifne sana jabeessaatii qabadhaa.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Gooftaan keenya Iisaa Al-Masiihi mataan isaa, Allaahan Abbaan keenya inni nu jaallatee karaa ayyaana isaatiin jajjabina bara baraatii fi abdii gaarii nuu kenne sun, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />hojii fi dubbii gaarii hunda keessatti garaa keessan haa jajjabeessu; isin haa cimsus.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Duʼaa Nuuf Godhaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Egaa yaa obboloota, akka dubbiin Gooftaa akkuma isin biratti taʼe sana dafee iddoo hunda gaʼuu fi akka ulfinas qabaatu duʼaa nuuf godhaa. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Akka nu harka namoota hamootii fi jalʼootaa jalaa baanuufis duʼaa nuuf godhaa; amantii kan qabu nama hunda mitii. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Gooftaan garuu amanamaa dha; inni isin cimsa; isa hamaa irraas isin eega. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Nu akka isin waan nu isin ajajne sana hojjechaa jirtan, akka ittuma fuftaniis hojjetan Gooftaa ni amananna. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Gooftaan garaa keessan gara jaalala Allaahatii fi gara obsa Al-Masiihiitti haa qajeelchu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dirqama Hojii Hojjechuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Yaa obboloota, isin obboleessa dhibaaʼaa fi kan akka bartee isin nurraa argattan sanaattis hin jiraanne hunda irraa akka fagaattaniif maqaa Gooftaa keenya Iisaa Al-Masiihiin isin ajajna. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Isin mataan keessan akkamitti akka fakkeenya keenya duukaa buʼuu qabdan ni beektuutii. Nu yeroo isin bira turretti dhibaaʼota hin turre; <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />nus akka isin keessaa nama tokkotti illee baʼaa hin taaneef jennee, dadhabbii fi tattaaffii guddaan halkanii guyyaa hojjechaa turre malee buddeena nama tokkoo illee tola hin nyaanne. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Nu fakkeenya isinii taʼuuf waan kana goone malee waan aangoo hin qabneef miti. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Nu yommuu isin bira turretti ajaja, “Namni hojjechuu hin barbaanne kam iyyuu hin nyaatin” jedhu isinii kenninee turreetii.<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Akka isin keessaa namoonni tokko tokko dhibaaʼota taʼanii jiraatan dhageenyeerraatii. Isaan dhimma nama biraa keessa galuu malee ofii isaaniitii waan tokko illee hin hojjetan. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Namoonni akkanaa akka gab jedhanii hojii hojjetanii fi akka buddeena ofii isaanii nyaataniif Gooftaa Iisaa Al-Masiihiin isaan ajajna; ni gorsinas. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Isin garuu yaa obboloota, waan gaarii hojjechuutti hin laafinaa.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Yoo namni kam iyyuu dubbii keenya kan xalayaa kana keessaatiif hin ajajamne, nama kana yaadatti qabadhaa. Akka inni qaanaʼuufis isa wajjin tokkummaa hin qabaatinaa. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Taʼus akka obboleessaatti isa gorsaa malee akka diinaatti isa hin ilaalinaa.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Dhaamsa Nagaa Xumuraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Gooftaan nagaa mataan isaas yeroo hunda, karaa hundaan nagaa isinii haa kennu. Gooftaan hunduma keessan wajjin haa taʼu.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Ani Phaawulos xalayaa kana harkuma kootiin barreessa; kunis mallattoo xalayoota koo hundaa ti. Akki ani itti barreessus kanuma.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Ayyaanni Gooftaa keenya Iisaa Al-Masiihii isin hunda wajjin haa taʼu.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>